Costa Rica requires utilities to install fast-charging stations every 50 miles on national highways. But many chargers don’t work.
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/03/business/costa-rica-electric-vehicle-road-trip.html</guid><pubDate>Sun, 03 May 2026 10:24:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Jeeves and Ask.com Shut Down After Almost 30 Years</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/03/business/ask-jeeves-shuts-down-internet-search-engine.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
