The Ask.com search engine website, with the illustration of the character Jeeves.
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/03/business/ask-jeeves-shuts-down-internet-search-engine.html</guid><pubDate>Sun, 03 May 2026 05:36:36 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>OPEC Plus, in Symbolic Gesture, to Increase Oil Production</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/03/business/opec-plus-oil-production-united-arab-emirates.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
