&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/03/multimedia/03BIZ-SPIRIT-FALLOUT1-zcgh/03BIZ-SPIRIT-FALLOUT1-zcgh-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
Spirit Airlines’ presence at an airport usually helped to push down the fares of all airlines operating there.
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/03/business/spirit-airlines-shutdown-fares-industry-impact.html</guid><pubDate>Sun, 03 May 2026 07:06:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>‘Devil Wears Prada’ Sequel Leads Box Office With $77 Million</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/03/business/devil-wears-prada-2-box-office.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
