]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/03/business/devil-wears-prada-2-box-office.html</guid><pubDate>Sun, 03 May 2026 10:08:28 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>E.E.O.C. Investigating Discrimination Claim at The New York Times</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/03/business/economy/eeoc-discrimination-claim-new-york-times.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/03/multimedia/03BIZ-EEOC-wbqz/03BIZ-EEOC-wbqz-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
The Equal Employment Opportunity Commission is investigating a reverse-discrimination claim filed against The New York Times by a white male employee.
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/03/business/economy/eeoc-discrimination-claim-new-york-times.html</guid><pubDate>Sun, 03 May 2026 11:29:51 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Oil Prices Fall While Stock Futures Inch Up</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/03/business/oil-prices-stocks-iran.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/03/multimedia/03biz-oil-stocks-gas-1-zlfj/03biz-oil-stocks-gas-1-zlfj-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
Oil prices fell and futures on the S&amp;amp;P 500 rose slightly on Sunday as investors reacted to continued uncertainty about the war in Iran.
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/03/business/oil-prices-stocks-iran.html</guid><pubDate>Sun, 03 May 2026 13:12:06 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>